<h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold">About</h1>
<p class="mt-3 text-foreground-second">This page is <code>src/routes/about.nexy</code>, so its address is <code>/about</code>. The Python between the <code>---</code> lines runs on the server for each visit; the HTML after it is the page.</p>
